{
  "title": "iOS missing auto-enrichment features (enrich, generate \
photo/description, normalize title)",
  "description": "Web exposes the full AI enrichment suite \
(ramekin-ui/src/utils/aiEnrichments.ts, used from ViewRecipePage.tsx): \
enrichRecipe, generatePhoto, generateDescription, normalizeTitle, plus \
rescrapePhoto. iOS only calls EnrichAPI.customEnrichRecipe \
(CustomEnrichSheet.swift) — the one-tap auto variants are entirely absent.\n\
\n\
Bring iOS to parity: from the recipe detail view (RecipeDetailView.swift and \
its sections), expose auto-enrich, generate photo, generate description, and \
normalize title, going through the generated client (EnrichAPI/RecipesAPI). \
Reuse the existing EnrichPreviewSheet.swift preview/accept flow where it \
fits.\n\
\n\
All the server endpoints already exist and are exercised by web, so this is \
iOS-only UI + wiring work.",
